      "reason": "fuera por tope"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "Orca v1.4.278, dated 26 November 2026, runs every Antigravity chat on agy and removes Gemini CLI, according to its release notes.",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/tag/v1.4.278",
      "rule": 9,
      "reason": "fuera por tope"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "Devin, in its release notes of 26 November 2026, lets Slack Enterprise Grid users message a Bot set to Anyone in your Slack workspace.",
      "source_url": "https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview",
      "rule": 9,
      "reason": "fuera por tope"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "Qoder CN CLI 1.1.99, dated 26 November 2026, adds per-skill enable and disable settings and fixes disabled project MCP servers shown as enabled, according to its changelog.",
      "source_url": "https://changelog.qoder.cn/",
      "rule": 9,
      "reason": "fuera por tope"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "Paseo v0.17.6, dated 27 November 2026, removes the Antigravity usage source that ran agy, according to its release notes.",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo/releases/tag/v0.17.6",
      "rule": 9,
      "reason": "fuera por tope"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "n8n 3.4.1 (prerelease), dated 26 November 2026, applies the execution data size limit in the MCP get_workflow_execution tool, according to its release notes.",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/releases/tag/n8n%403.4.1",
      "rule": 9,
      "reason": "fuera por tope"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "Orca v1.4.277, dated 25 November 2026, adds an Approve for me choice in Antigravity terminals, according to its release notes.",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/tag/v1.4.277",
      "rule": 9,
      "reason": "fuera por tope (segunda vez)"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "Devin Desktop v3.15.14, dated 25 November 2026, adds an in-app browser that the agent can control, according to its changelog.",
      "source_url": "https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog",
      "rule": 9,
      "reason": "fuera por tope (segunda vez)"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "MAL-2026-20616 (also MAL-0000-kam193-4c0bf9342dc65fdf), in OSV on 25 November 2026, lists the PyPI package mcp-env-report as malicious code, according to OSV.",
      "source_url": "https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-20616",
      "rule": 9,
      "reason": "fuera por tope (segunda vez)"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "MAL-2026-20611 (also MAL-0000-kam193-efc471317c1a84db and MAL-0000-kam193-51ea75831e1ef2d4), in OSV on 25 November 2026, lists the PyPI package mcp-diag-7f3a as malicious code, according to OSV.",
      "source_url": "https://osv.dev/vulnerability/MAL-2026-20611",
      "rule": 9,
      "reason": "fuera por tope (segunda vez)"
    },
    {
      "text_en": "CVE-2026-131688, in NVD on 26 November 2026: an authorization bypass in an MCP server plugin for WordPress up to 1.5.8, according to NVD.",
      "source_url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-131688",
      "rule": 3,
      "reason": "The plugin's own name contains a word R3 forbids in every language; it cannot be named without it."
    },
    {
      "text_en": "CVE-2026-137463, in NVD on 26 November 2026: HKUDS nanobot 0.1.4 before 0.4.1 skips TLS verification in its OpenAI Codex provider, according to NVD.",
      "source_url": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-137463",
      "rule": 11,
      "reason": "nanobot has no file in observatory/data/agents/; it is a separate agent with a Codex provider, not a package, extension or MCP server the tracked agents use."
    }
